  "context": "## Luxury Recommendation\nIndustrial Case · Luxury Operations · Recommendation Systems · Vector Databases · SLM Architecture · Enterprise Data\n\nIn a high-end luxury group, a recommendation engine cannot be treated as a small add-on inside SAP, Salesforce or any single application.\n\nThe problem is not merely to search for products or to show “people who bought X also bought Y”. Recommendation in this context means connecting, in real time and with high precision:\n\nProduct and reference, client and household, purchase history, repair and after-sales history, style, aesthetics and cultural context.\n\nEvents, invitations, scarcity, boutique, region, channel, collection logic, design narratives, technical documentation and training content.\nTags: Authority, permissions and delegation 13.34%; Decisions and responsibility 13.33%; Business and management 73.33%\nCard: https://dakleyer.github.io/perspective-beyond/sources/luxury-recommendation-e1570/\nSource document: https://jubap.eu/luxury-recommendation-intelligence/\n\n",
